{"seq":1,"slug":"skill-manage-trigger-conditions","title":"skill_manage 工具的触发条件","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/skills-self-creation/skill-manage-trigger-conditions","wordCount":1327,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"skill_manage-工具的触发条件\">skill_manage 工具的触发条件</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Hermes 的 <code>skill_manage</code> 工具实现&quot;agent 自己提议新 skill&quot;的能力，而非 Tier 1 那种&quot;用户手写 SKILL.md 再 commit&quot;的纯手工流程。它在两条路径触发：一是<strong>用户重复工作流的自动检测</strong>——Hermes 持续观察用户交互，发现相似 task 重复 3 次以上时主动提议把它固化为 skill；二是<strong>用户显式 <code>/promote-to-skill</code> 命令</strong>——用户认为某次会话值得沉淀，主动指示 Hermes 把当前 trajectory 抽成 skill。两条路径之后是同一个 propose-review-accept 三段流程，由 user 拥有最终 accept/reject 决定权。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  A[用户交互流] --&gt; B{自动检测器}&#10;  C[/promote-to-skill/] --&gt; D&#10;  B -- 重复模式命中 --&gt; D[Propose draft]&#10;  D --&gt; E{用户 review}&#10;  E -- accept --&gt; F[Write SKILL.md]&#10;  E -- modify --&gt; D&#10;  E -- reject --&gt; G[Mark trajectory&lt;br/&gt;do-not-propose]\">flowchart LR\n  A[用户交互流] --&gt; B{自动检测器}\n  C[/promote-to-skill/] --&gt; D\n  B -- 重复模式命中 --&gt; D[Propose draft]\n  D --&gt; E{用户 review}\n  E -- accept --&gt; F[Write SKILL.md]\n  E -- modify --&gt; D\n  E -- reject --&gt; G[Mark trajectory&lt;br/&gt;do-not-propose]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发路径</th>\n<th>决策方</th>\n<th>主动性</th>\n<th>误触代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动检测</td>\n<td>Hermes 提议 + 用户 accept</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>用户 reject 一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>/promote-to-skill</code></td>\n<td>用户主动</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tier 1 手写 SKILL.md</td>\n<td>用户全权</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>用户写错则一直错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自动检测算法\">自动检测算法</h2><p>自动检测核心是<strong>滑动窗口 + 命名相似度阈值 + 关键操作序列匹配</strong>三个组件级联。Hermes 维护最近 30 天的 task trajectory ring buffer，每个 trajectory 包含 user 第一条 message / Hermes 调用的 tool 序列 / 关键中间产物 / 最终输出。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  T1[trajectory_1] --&gt; N[Normalize]&#10;  T2[trajectory_2] --&gt; N&#10;  T3[trajectory_3] --&gt; N&#10;  N --&gt; S[Compute similarity matrix]&#10;  S --&gt; C{&gt;=3 trajectories&lt;br/&gt;cluster sim &gt; 0.72?}&#10;  C -- yes --&gt; P[Propose skill draft]&#10;  C -- no --&gt; W[Keep watching]\">flowchart TD\n  T1[trajectory_1] --&gt; N[Normalize]\n  T2[trajectory_2] --&gt; N\n  T3[trajectory_3] --&gt; N\n  N --&gt; S[Compute similarity matrix]\n  S --&gt; C{&gt;=3 trajectories&lt;br/&gt;cluster sim &gt; 0.72?}\n  C -- yes --&gt; P[Propose skill draft]\n  C -- no --&gt; W[Keep watching]</pre><p>相似度由三个子分数加权：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子分数</th>\n<th>权重</th>\n<th>计算</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>user_intent_sim</td>\n<td>0.4</td>\n<td>first message embedding cosine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tool_sequence_sim</td>\n<td>0.4</td>\n<td>tool 调用序列 Jaccard，顺序敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>artifact_sim</td>\n<td>0.2</td>\n<td>关键中间产物的字段名 / 文件类型 set 重合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>总分公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>tools</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>tools</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sim}(t_i, t_j) = 0.4 \\cdot \\cos(v_i, v_j) + 0.4 \\cdot J(\\text{tools}_i, \\text{tools}_j) + 0.2 \\cdot |F_i \\cap F_j| / |F_i \\cup F_j|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tools</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tools</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣/∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>cluster 用 DBSCAN，eps=0.28（对应 sim=0.72），min_samples=3。当 cluster 形成时 trigger propose。</p>\n<p>阈值 0.72 不是凭空——Hermes telemetry 在 1000 条 trajectory 标注集上做过 grid search，0.72 时 precision=0.88 / recall=0.61。低于 0.65 时误触多到用户烦躁，高于 0.78 时漏触率超 50% 让自动检测意义不大。</p>\n<h2 id=\"关键操作序列匹配\">关键操作序列匹配</h2><p>不是所有相似都值得提议 skill——&quot;用户每天问当天天气&quot; 表层 message 相似，但工具调用单调，没有 skill 化价值。Hermes 加一道<strong>关键操作序列长度 &gt;= 3</strong> 的过滤：trajectory 内必须至少有 3 个不重复的 tool 调用（不含纯文本回复），才进入 cluster 计算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def is_skillable(trajectory):&#10;    tools = [step.tool for step in trajectory if step.is_tool_call]&#10;    unique_tools = set(tools)&#10;    if len(unique_tools) &lt; 3:&#10;        return False&#10;    if len(tools) &lt; 5:&#10;        return False&#10;    return True\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> is_skillable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(trajectory):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    tools </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [step.tool </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trajectory </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step.is_tool_call]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    unique_tools </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tools)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(unique_tools) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tools) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这道过滤保留&quot;多步骤多工具协作&quot;的 trajectory，过滤掉&quot;单一 query/response&quot; 的轻量交互。</p>\n<h2 id=\"promote-to-skill-显式命令\">/promote-to-skill 显式命令</h2><p>用户在会话中输入 <code>/promote-to-skill &lt;name&gt;</code> 或 <code>/promote-to-skill --auto</code> 时，Hermes 把当前会话从开头到这一刻的 trajectory 全部送进 skill 抽取流程。<code>--auto</code> 模式下 name / description / triggers 都由 Hermes 自动生成；不带 <code>--auto</code> 时只生成 description 与 triggers，name 用用户给的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"&gt; 我刚搞清楚怎么用 lark-base + lark-doc 组合做项目周报了&#10;&gt; /promote-to-skill weekly-report-base-to-doc&#10;&#10;[Hermes] 我会基于刚才的对话抽出 skill 草案。给我 3 秒...&#10;&#10;[Skill draft]&#10;name: weekly-report-base-to-doc&#10;description: 从指定 lark-base 表汇总本周条目,渲染成 lark-doc 周报模板&#10;triggers:&#10;  - &quot;本周项目周报&quot;&#10;  - &quot;汇总 base 到周报&quot;&#10;  - &quot;/weekly-report&quot;&#10;steps: [...]&#10;&#10;接受这份草案吗？[y/edit/n]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>> 我刚搞清楚怎么用 lark-base + lark-doc 组合做项目周报了</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>> /promote-to-skill weekly-report-base-to-doc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Hermes] 我会基于刚才的对话抽出 skill 草案。给我 3 秒...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Skill draft]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>name: weekly-report-base-to-doc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>description: 从指定 lark-base 表汇总本周条目,渲染成 lark-doc 周报模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>triggers:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - \"本周项目周报\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - \"汇总 base 到周报\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  - \"/weekly-report\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>steps: [...]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>接受这份草案吗？[y/edit/n]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>显式命令路径比自动检测的相似度门槛松——只要 trajectory 包含 &gt;= 2 个 tool 调用就接受 promote。</p>\n<h2 id=\"propose-review-accept-三段流程\">propose-review-accept 三段流程</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>产物</th>\n<th>用户操作</th>\n<th>失败路径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Propose</td>\n<td>draft SKILL.md + diff</td>\n<td>看 description / triggers / steps</td>\n<td>等待</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Review</td>\n<td>用户编辑或追问</td>\n<td>accept / modify / reject</td>\n<td>不动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accept</td>\n<td>写入 <code>~/.learnwy/hermes/skills/&lt;name&gt;/SKILL.md</code></td>\n<td>立即可用</td>\n<td>reject 标记 do-not-propose</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Accept 写入文件后 Hermes 立即 reload skill registry，下一条 user message 触发 skill matcher 时新 skill 就在候选集里。Reject 不删 trajectory，但把 trajectory 标 <code>skill_reject: true</code>，自动检测器后续不再为它出 propose。</p>\n<h2 id=\"防误触机制\">防误触机制</h2><p>自动检测过于热情会让用户烦——每 3 天就被弹一次 &quot;要不要把这个变 skill&quot;。Hermes 加四道防误触：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防御层</th>\n<th>规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最低间隔</td>\n<td>同用户每 7 天最多 3 个自动 propose</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒绝记忆</td>\n<td>reject 过的 trajectory cluster 永久 mute</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局 cap</td>\n<td>用户 skill 总数 &gt;= 50 时只 propose 不主动弹</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静默模式</td>\n<td><code>hermes config skill.auto_propose=false</code> 彻底关闭</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一道与第三道避免 propose 风暴，第二道避免重复 propose 同一类，第四道给&quot;我自己写 skill&quot;的用户完全控制权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与-tier-1-skill-md-流程对照\">与 Tier 1 SKILL.md 流程对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Tier 1（Claude Code）</th>\n<th>Tier 2（Hermes skill_manage）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>来源</td>\n<td>用户手写</td>\n<td>自动检测 + 显式 promote</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>评审</td>\n<td>自审 + git review</td>\n<td>propose-review-accept</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>触发器学习</td>\n<td>用户手写 description</td>\n<td>从 trajectory 学习 + GEPA refine</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>演进</td>\n<td>用户主动改</td>\n<td>curator 周期 refine</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Tier 1 SKILL.md 是&quot;我现在需要这个能力 → 手写一份&quot;，Tier 2 是&quot;系统观察到我重复这件事 → 系统主动提议&quot;。两者不互斥——Tier 1 写完 SKILL.md commit 进 git 后，Hermes 也能 import 进自己 registry 用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>自动 propose 一直不触发</strong>：检查日志，多半是关键操作序列长度门槛没过——用户大量交互是单一 tool 调用，正常。考虑用 <code>/promote-to-skill</code> 主动提议。</li>\n<li><strong>同一类 task 反复被提议</strong>：上次 reject 了但 trajectory 哈希变了（user message 措辞略改），mute 没覆盖。手动 <code>hermes skill mute &lt;pattern&gt;</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>新 skill 创建后不生效</strong>：可能 reload failed。检查 <code>hermes skill reload --verbose</code> 输出，常见原因是 SKILL.md frontmatter 语法错。</li>\n<li><strong>不希望系统观察 trajectory</strong>：<code>hermes config skill.auto_propose=false</code> 关闭自动，但 trajectory 仍被记录用于 curator——彻底关需要 <code>hermes config telemetry=false</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p><code>skill_manage</code> 把&quot;识别用户重复模式 + 提议 skill 草案&quot;从手工劳动变成 agent 主动行为。自动检测靠&quot;相似度 0.72 + 关键操作序列 &gt;= 3 + 滑动窗口 cluster&quot;三层级联，user 显式 <code>/promote-to-skill</code> 走更松的旁路，最终都收敛到 propose-review-accept 三段交接给用户裁决。这套机制减少了&quot;我应该把这件事固化&quot;的 cognitive load，但代价是需要细致的防误触阈值。下一篇看 curator 如何在 skill 创建之后周期 review、决定 keep / refine / retire。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"skill_manage 工具的触发条件","id":"skill_manage-工具的触发条件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自动检测算法","id":"自动检测算法"},{"level":2,"text":"关键操作序列匹配","id":"关键操作序列匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"/promote-to-skill 显式命令","id":"promote-to-skill-显式命令"},{"level":2,"text":"propose-review-accept 三段流程","id":"propose-review-accept-三段流程"},{"level":2,"text":"防误触机制","id":"防误触机制"},{"level":2,"text":"与 Tier 1 SKILL.md 流程对照","id":"与-tier-1-skill-md-流程对照"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Curator 维护周期与自演进","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/persistent-memory/curator-maintenance-cycle"},"next":{"title":"Curator 周期 review skill 的 keep / refine / retire 决策","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/modules-deep/skills-self-creation/curator-skill-review-cycle"}}